<div class="description en" dir="ltr" lang="en"><span class="language en" title="English"><b>English&#58; </b></span> The <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fontana_Pretoria" class="extiw" title="w:Fontana Pretoria"><i>Fontana pretoria</i></a> fountain on <i>Piazza Pretoria</i> square in <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Palermo" class="extiw" title="w:Palermo">Palermo</a>.</div>
